{"title": "Special Arrow Subtable", "pageid": 15038, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Special_Arrow_Subtable", "categories": ["Leveled drop tables", "Drop tables", "Subtables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Special Arrow Subtable</b>, also known as <code>ST_SpecialArrow</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_SpecialArrow+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_SpecialArrow+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> that includes most kinds of <a href=\"/wiki/Arrows\" title=\"Arrows\">arrows</a> in the game, except <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barbed_Arrow\" title=\"Barbed Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barbed_Arrow\" title=\"Barbed Arrow\">Barbed Arrow</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{#lst:Special Arrow Subtable|table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 1 - 5</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Common_Special_Arrow_Subtable\" title=\"Common Special Arrow Subtable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Arrow_of_Fire_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Common_Special_Arrow_Subtable\" title=\"Common Special Arrow Subtable\">Common Special Arrow Subtable</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2/3</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uncommon_Special_Arrow_Subtable\" title=\"Uncommon Special Arrow Subtable\"><