_Arrow_Subtable\" title=\"Common Special Arrow Subtable\">Common Special Arrow Subtable</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/4</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uncommon_Special_Arrow_Subtable\" title=\"Uncommon Special Arrow Subtable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Uncommon_Special_Arrow_Subtable\" title=\"Uncommon Special Arrow Subtable\">Uncommon Special Arrow Subtable</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/4</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rare_Special_Arrow_Subtable\" title=\"Rare Special Arrow Subtable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Smokepowder_Arrow_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Smokepowder_Arrow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Smokepowder_Arrow_Unfaded_